{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay cool and stylish this summer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This set features summer-themed outfits, light gear, and refreshing hair dye colors to match the season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find them at Matsuri and Kagari on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dress for the weather and enjoy a sunny day in Elnea Kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbOutfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summer Outfit: Clean-Cut, Summer Kid: Clean-Cut, Sunset Sunglasses, Summer Outfit: Sunny, Summer Kid: Sunny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbEquipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minipack: Sunny, Waist Pouch: Sunny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbDyes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sandy Blond Hair Dye, Blue Silver Hair Dye</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828630?t=1751933398","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828630?t=1751933398","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828630/6f385a